label Greeting
label CollectionIntro
ReynaMayari: I am here for tonight's tally.
ReynaMayari: The remaining balance on Lola's ledger is [color=#b0c4de]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] of [color=#b0c4de]{Global_TallyGoal}[/color] pesos.
ReynaMayari: Tonight, I expect at least [color=#b0c4de]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos. Decide what you will offer. [pause=0.4]
[signal arg="open_tally_offer"]
[wait time="0.5"]
[end_timeline]

label Generous
ReynaMayari: ...You offered [color=#f5d76e]{Global_TallyOffer}[/color] pesos. More than I asked. [pause=0.5]
ReynaMayari: Only [color=#b0c4de]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain. [pause=0.3] The silver spires remember generosity.
if {Global_QuotaDay} == 2.0:
	ReynaMayari: Actually, I've been meaning to see what your store offers by daylight.
	ReynaMayari: Expect a visit from me soon. [pause=0.4]
ReynaMayari: Until tomorrow. [pause=0.3]
[end_timeline]

label Success
ReynaMayari: [color=#f5d76e]{Global_TallyOffer}[/color] pesos recorded in the Silver Ledger. [pause=0.4]
ReynaMayari: [color=#b0c4de]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain on your grandmother's pact.
if {Global_QuotaDay} == 2.0:
	ReynaMayari: Actually, I've been meaning to check what your store offers.
	ReynaMayari: I think I will see what you have here tomorrow. [pause=0.5]
ReynaMayari: Until tomorrow. [pause=0.3]
[end_timeline]

label Shortfall
label Angry
if {Global_TallyOffer} <= 0:
	ReynaMayari: [wave blue]Nothing at all tonight?[/wave] [pause=0.5]
	ReynaMayari: [color=#b0c4de]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos still stand unpaid. Expect a chill over Karimlan tomorrow.
else:
	ReynaMayari: [wave blue]Only {Global_TallyOffer} pesos.[/wave] [pause=0.5] That falls short of tonight's expectation.
	ReynaMayari: [color=#b0c4de]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain. Expect... [pause=0.3] a mild chill over Karimlan tomorrow.
[end_timeline]

label LedgerCleared
ReynaMayari: It is done. [pause=0.5]
ReynaMayari: Every last peso of your bloodline's tally has been settled.
ReynaMayari: As Queen of Biringan, I declare the pact sealed and renewed. Karimlan rests under my protection. [pause=0.4]
ReynaMayari: Keep your coins from now on, child. [pause=0.3] I will... see myself out.
[end_timeline]